# Example raw IR file for ir-ctl --send
# Replace this file with a real capture:
#   /root/ir/capture-xiaomi-power.sh
#
# Format is mode2 / pulse space durations in microseconds, e.g.:
#   pulse 9000
#   space 4500
#   pulse 560
#   space 560
#   ...
#
# Copy a successful capture to:
#   /root/ir/xiaomi_power.ir
#
# Do not use this example for transmission — it is documentation only.
